  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWE Association of Local Authorities &amp; Regions SALAR IRQ Decentralization 23-25 - Decentralisation  2023-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges Kommuner och Regioner (SKR) Irak- Decentralisation 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is that &quot;Local government institutions - particularly in Anbar, Diwaniyah, Duhok and Muthanna governorates - will became more effective, inclusive an accountable, collaborate and coordinate constructively with federal and regional authorities, and provide services responding to the needs of vulnerable groups of men, women, boys and girls.&quot; 

The outcomes of the project are:

- Strengthened Policy formulation and fact-based planning capacities.

- More effective local financial management and budgeting processes.

- Improved local systems of protection for vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det har inkommit en projektans&#xf6;kan till Sida om en budget p&#xe5; MSEK 101,3 f&#xf6;r att implementera ett program v g decetralisering under perioden 2023-2026.

Projektet bygger p&#xe5; tidigare projekt och syftar till att bidra till Iraks decentraliseringsreform och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av sociala tj&#xe4;nster i fyra guvernorater, Duhok, Diwaniyah, Muthanna och Al-Anbar med m&#xe5;l att: 1) St&#xe4;rkt policyarbete och faktabaserad planering 2)  finansiell management och budgetprocess som bidrar till effektiv decentralisering i Muthanna, Diwaniyah och Al-Anbar. Guvernoraterna str&#xe4;var &#xe4;ven efter att fungera som modell f&#xf6;r &#xf6;vriga Irak och 3) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade lokala skyddssystem f&#xf6;r s&#xe5;rbara grupper i Duhok, Iraks Kurdistan.

Projektet kommer att implementera tillsammans med en lokal organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project application is for  decentralisation in Iraq for the period of 2023-2026 was submitted with a requested budget of MSEK 101,3

The project aims to contribute to Iraq&apos;s decentralisation reform and improving social services in the guvernorates of Duhok, Diwaniyah, Muthanna and Al-Anbar with the following objectives: 1) Strengthened policy formulation and fact-based planning capacities. 2) More effective local financial management and budgeting processes together with 3) Improved local systems of protection for vulnerable groups in Duhok, Kurdistan. 
The project will implemented in collaborate with a local organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
